    <h3>🚀 View Engine Highlights</h3>
    <ul>
    <li><strong>Composition Engine:</strong> Real template inheritance via <code>&#64;extends</code>, <code>&#64;section</code>, <code>&#64;yield</code>, <code>&#64;parent</code>, and <code>&#64;show</code>.</li>
